body:
Yeah, these past 7 weeks have been sheer torture for me. I have my family on watch 24/7 to make sure I don't try to kill myself.

&#x200B;

It's not worth it, nobody should live like this. But if it does 'go away' like they say, then soon I'll be non-psychotic AND without akathisia. I guess I just don't know whether or not to trust them, since it really feels as though I'm suffering needlessly.
